# Microsoft Store submission API coordinates for scripts/ci/msstore-submit.sh
# (ut-docs#6407). A data file on purpose: the store-private guard
# (scripts/ci/guard-store-private.sh) scans code, and the submit path is held
# shut by store-release/microsoft.opened instead until the owner's opening
# card (ut-docs#6408). KEY=value, no quoting; {app} and {sub} are substituted.
# UNVERIFIED against a live tenant: the owner/opening card confirms these and
# the package JSON shape in msstore-submit.sh with a real dry run first.
API_BASE=https://manage.devcenter.microsoft.com/v1.0/my
TOKEN_RESOURCE=https://manage.devcenter.microsoft.com
CREATE_PATH=/applications/{app}/submissions
UPDATE_PATH=/applications/{app}/submissions/{sub}
COMMIT_PATH=/applications/{app}/submissions/{sub}/commit
